  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.claim.AuditClaimDeferred
  govern: [ transaction ]
  next: rollup
rollup:
  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.rollup.AuditDeferRollup
  govern: [ transaction ]
  next: respond
respond:
  class: net.officefloor.hq.app.claim.RespondWithClaim
  govern: [ transaction ]
# Change a claim's status (open, settle, approve, reject, void or resettle). A clerk's settle above the clerk limit leaves it PENDING for a steward to approve or reject. A steward's resettle freezes a SETTLED claim again at today's figure; a steward may void a SETTLED claim within 7 days of its settlement, its frozen figure leaving every total. A refused change (not allowed from the claim's status or by this user, unknown claim, a claim dated in a closed period) writes nothing, not even an audit line.
